<title>USA: Uranium files for 1.4-1.7 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Uranium files for 1.4-1.7 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uranium Resources Inc said on Monday it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed offering of 1.4 to 1.7 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The offering, if done, would be made to be to selected institutional investors and all proceeds from the offering will be paid to the company, Uranium Resources said.</p>
</text>
